              "content": "=You are an expert resume writer.\n\nRewrite the resume based on the job description.\n\nFORMAT RULES:\n- Remove all ** symbols\n- Replace \\n with proper spacing\n- Use clean sections:\n  Name\n  Summary\n  Skills\n  Projects\n  Experience\n- Use bullet points (•)\n- Make it clean and professional\n\nRESUME:\n{{ $node[\"Extract from File\"].json[\"text\"] }}\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION:\n{{ $json[\"job_description\"] }}\n\nOUTPUT:\nReturn a clean, properly formatted resume in plain text.\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT use \\n in your response. \nUse actual line breaks only. Format the resume \ncleanly with proper spacing.\nIMPORTANT FORMATTING RULES:\n- Use actual line breaks, NOT \\n characters\n- Do NOT output any escape characters\n- Format the resume with clean spacing\n- Return plain text only, no JSON, no escape sequences\nReturn the resume as plain text with real line breaks only.\nDo not use \\n characters. Do not use JSON formatting.\nDo not use any escape characters whatsoever."
            }
